	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020130"},
		line=930,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It was all because of my immaturity...”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Because I never gave the order to retreat, the entire Myougi Squad was wiped out.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Inou practically spits out those last words as she casts her gaze upwards.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"She breathes a long sigh that seems to carry her deep-seated regrets drifting up into the night sky.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"I was intending to ask her about what happened when we came to take out the trash, and before I knew it, we'd already been sitting here for a long while.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"It took some prodding before she felt comfortable talking.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"But once the dam of her resistance burst, all her pent-up feelings came rushing out.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"The can of sweet red bean soup I bought has long since gone cold in my hands.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Even now... I wish that I'd died back then.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I still can't understand why I survived and they didn't.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But there are things that you can only do because you survived.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Just look at Kokuan─he founded the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He wouldn't have been able to do that if he died, right?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You have a point.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But even so, I haven't been able to do anything.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki went ahead and resigned because he decided I\nwasn't worth entrusting his life to.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Inou rubs her neck in chagrin.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It would have been better if Maki had taken over the Sworn Blades after Father was arrested.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He's much more fit for the role, in terms of both experience and ability.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But you were still chosen. Isn't that what counts?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's only because of my bloodline, that's all.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then is it only because of ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"my",
{"/font"},
" bloodline that you're serving me?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course not!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“When I swore my fealty to you, I unmistakably felt the aura of a true Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm not just serving you due to your bloodline.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In that case, I'm sure the warriors of the Sworn Blades also feel the aura of a true leader from you.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If they didn't, they wouldn't be putting their lives in your hands.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm the warrior who led the Myougi Squad to ruin.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If that's how you're playing it, I'm the daughter of the Empress who had her country stolen from her.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You sure you want to take someone like that as your lord? Am I truly worthy?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What are you even saying?!”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Inou leaps to her feet.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"are",
{"/font"},
" worthy of being my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“For what it's worth, I only accepted you because I thought you were worthy of being my vassal.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I wouldn't have accepted just anyone, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm unworthy of such recognition.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Listen, Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I really believe that you have what it takes to unite the warriors, as the head of House Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But the head is...”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"I grab her by the shoulders before she finishes her sentence.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Y-Yes!?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"I stare directly into her wavering eyes.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm talking to Inou Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kokuan has nothing to do with it!”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sure there's plenty of hardship in store for you as leader of the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But I can't solve any of your problems on your behalf, and I can't unite the Blades in your place.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's why I'm entrusting the Sworn Blades to you.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Miyaguni...”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I have complete faith that you'll be able to handle it.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"are",
{"/font"},
" worthy of being my vassal.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't let me down, you hear?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"The look of tension on Inou's face falters, then finally breaks.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"She hurriedly casts her gaze downwards, and all I can see are her quivering lips.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"I avert my gaze to look up at the night sky, yet the twinkling of the stars above is somehow less noble than the drops of starlight falling down upon her lap.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“By the way, what happened with Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've been avoiding him all day.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm not avoiding him.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm just acting the way I ought to be.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, really? What a shame. I thought you two were perfect for each other.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I think you have the wrong idea.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin... doesn't feel anything for me.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But you've been together since you were kids, haven't you?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And he hasn't ever seemed to mind keeping you company.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Anything that happened in our past is dead and gone.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Miyaguni draws a small breath at this stark declaration.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin and I have only known each other for three years.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's what it means to lose your memories, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sorry, I spoke without thinking...”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Miyaguni mutters with a crestfallen expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't worry about it.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thinking about it now, maybe it's a good thing that he forgot.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Can I ask why?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Even I'm startled at how quickly I've let my guard down with Miyaguni.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"I feel secure in the knowledge that no matter what I tell her, she'll accept it all with absolute sincerity.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"I suppose it is only fitting that an Empress should possess such a quality.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This happened back during the war.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"That day, the Warrior District was bombed without warning and engulfed by a sea of flames in the blink of an eye.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Soujin declared he was going off on his own right after the\nRepublic's air raids began.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry. I must go to fulfill my duty.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're not chickening out on me, are you?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're warriors, aren't we?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now is the time to earn our keep.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Soujin shows me that familiar, terribly lame smile I've seen a thousand times by now.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't I know that.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You go fight your own battle.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's funny, isn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For the longest time, I've believed that I wouldn't get the chance to fight alongside you.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'd always figured we'd meet our ends in different places.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you planning on dying on me?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Fear not. We will surely meet again.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Goodbye, for now.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Soujin turns and heads off without another word.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"His long strides carry him farther and farther away.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"This might be the last time I ever see him...",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"At this thought, my body moves entirely on reflex.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"He turns around, a slight look of bewilderment crossing his face.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I love you, Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"All my life, I've never once been able to say it, but here and now, my words come out unbelievably clearly.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Oh, was it really so easy this whole time?",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Even as my words disappear on the wind, the feelings they gave shape to continue to burn within my heart.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Not the faint spark that's been smoldering there all this time.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"But a roaring brazier, hotter than the sun, warming me up from inside.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Please, tell me your answer once the battle is over.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We will meet again... won't we?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Ah, there's that lame smile of his...",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Good hunting, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Good hunting.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“By some miracle, we both managed to survive and reunite with each other.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But... Soujin's memories were all gone.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course, that includes my parting words.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Not only was there nothing left of the time we spent together, he couldn't even remember my name.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll never forget the look in his eyes when we first reunited, like he was meeting a total stranger for the first time.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I never knew...”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Miyaguni trails off, her face filled with forlorn sympathy.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I don't have any intention of blaming him.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm just glad he survived, truly.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Plus, if it weren't for him, I think I would've killed myself long ago.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The thought of needing to take care of Soujin was the only thing kept me alive after the war.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I convinced myself that he'd be totally hopeless if I\nweren't around.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"But then, Miyaguni came into the picture.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Desperately clinging on to that justification, I tried to take Soujin back from her by force.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Just like a toddler throwing a tantrum to prevent her favorite doll from being taken away.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"How disgraceful of me...",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know, I've also thought that Soujin's a wonderful guy more than a few times.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Miyaguni stares vacantly at the sky full of stars.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“During the war, Soujin was the one that saved my life.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He's the reason that I had enough time to flee Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If it weren't for him, I wouldn't be here right now.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That means... after he parted ways with me, he...”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"He broke off from the Myougi Squad in order to fly to\nMiyaguni's aid.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"...Why did he do that?",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Was he under some secret orders?",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm jealous of you.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, it's not like I was trying to brag, or anything.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We both know he'd just be all like, 'There can be no romance between a warrior and his lord,' right?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So y'know, I feel like we're in the same boat.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, you have a good point.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That guy doesn't know what he's missing out on.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Letting two great catches get away just like that...”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"We both let out a giggle at this, even though it's at our own expense.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Miyaguni is opening up about herself, all in order to console me.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But you know, unlike me, you've still got a good chance.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He still hasn't given you his─”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's fine.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's better that he doesn't remember anything.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He'd never reciprocate my feelings anyways.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Why not?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Miyaguni's cheerful expression clouds over.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Because female warriors can't bear children.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Why am I telling all this to someone who's been trying so hard to cheer me up this whole time?",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Am I trying to throw her ignorance into her face as an excuse to vent my own frustrations?",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"How unsightly of me...",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I won't ever be able to have his child.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"I explain the details to a perplexed Miyaguni.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"As a general rule, the warrior factor, the source of our strength, only typically manifests in men.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"For every one hundred men, there might only be a single woman like Mutsumi, Koyuzu, or myself who possesses the warrior factor.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"And no woman who manifests the warrior factor will ever be capable of bearing children.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Is that so...?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sorry. I never knew.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It’s fine, really.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"I flash a casual smile to ease Miyaguni's grim expression.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The legacy of the warriors is only passed on through our blood.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's why warrior society places a lot of emphasis on the continuation of our bloodlines.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And so, it's only natural that because we can't have children, female warriors are viewed as being worthless.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Objectively speaking, we have no value to warrior society outside of our fighting ability.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But that's... I mean...”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Miyaguni vainly searches for some way to comfort me, but she comes up short.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"This is just the way of the world, after all.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"A reduction in the number of warriors would mean a weakening of the Empire's line of defense.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"And so, it could be said that carrying on your bloodline and siring heirs is just another aspect of a warrior's fealty.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Girls like me who manifest the factor... we have no choice but to fight.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If we don't fight with everything we’ve got and slay more enemies than any man, we might as well have never been born in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's the way of the world for female warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Does Soujin think the same way?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Probably.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That ass!”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Miyaguni leaps to her feet, intent on marching straight into Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hold it.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"I grab her soft, feminine arm, so different from my lean and muscular ones.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Everything I told you is just common sense for warriors. Soujin isn't in the wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But I can't just accept that!”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's fine. It's how things are.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou!”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Miyaguni!”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's fine.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How can you...?”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"The strength slips out of her body, and Miyaguni deflatedly sits back down.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"The can of red bean soup she dropped continues steadily pouring out its contents onto the ground.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"As I pick up the can and gently wipe off the sand covering its rim, I feel an inexplicable surge of warmth flooding my chest.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hypothetically... Purely hypothetically...”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If Soujin and I were to get together, that would mean the end of House Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“House Inou will be fine because we have lots of branch families, but House Tokita only has Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I wouldn't want to be that selfish.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What can I say, it's...”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's because, um...”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's all because... I love him.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"My cheeks feel as hot as a furnace.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"If I splashed water on them right now, I'm sure it'd send up a giant puff of steam.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"I keep staring straight down, not daring to meet Miyaguni's gaze.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So this is enough for me.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll be more than content if I could just tell him how I feel...”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"I have no idea what expression Miyaguni is wearing.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"But for some reason, I feel like she's smiling a kindly smile at me.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's so cute how pure you are.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"When I finally look up in puzzlement, she meets my gaze with an amused grin.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"I'm glad we were able to talk like this today.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"I feel so much better now that I've let everything out, and even more importantly, I've finally found the path I need to follow.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"I move to kneel before Miyaguni.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Where's this coming from?”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I won't waver because of Soujin anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I will devote everything to my blade, all that I might be of service to my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I swear to you I shall unite the Blades, all that we might someday fulfill our ambitions.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're gonna give up on Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Warriors have no need for affairs of the heart.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki only resigned because he couldn't stand how I was letting love lead me astray.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Especially as acting chairman, I have to be a warrior that\nwon't bring shame to my station.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't think there's anything shameful about being in love...”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But still... I entrust you with the fate of the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Unite the Blades if it's the last thing you do.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"I offer her a deep bow.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Miyaguni is my lord.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"We walk very different paths, and as such, I cannot look to her for help in fulfilling my sworn duties.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"But in exchange, she will unconditionally believe in her vassals, entrust everything to us, and continue to watch over us until the very end.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"That is the oath I swore to her, and she to me.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"I shall see to it─No, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"all of the Sworn",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Blades shall see to it",
